  "id": "role-model",
  "term": "role model",
  "definition": "A role model is a person whose behavior or qualities are observed and used as a guide for what to copy, avoid, or adapt. In learning, this can involve imitating one individual, or combining selected traits from several people into a mentally constructed “composite” role model.",
